<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 37.61 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 37.61 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 37.61 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 155.42 on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
